Built-in desktop pet characters

The plugin code is licensed separately under the MIT License (see ../LICENSE).

eduwork-page, eduwork-page-blue (小页 / Page)
---------------------------------------------

Artwork by EduWork contributors, licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The SVG files are generated by scripts/build-page-skins.mjs, which is part of
the same artwork.

ecnu-huashi (小花狮 / Huashi)
----------------------------

The 小花狮 character and the East China Normal University emblem belong to
East China Normal University.

The early prototype and asset collection were contributed by xhan51
(https://github.com/ECNU/EduWork-ECNU/pull/18). This version was redrawn as
SVG by JunieXD and connected to the shared desktop pet framework.

The SVG files are generated by scripts/build-huashi-skin.mjs.

dafeiyu (大肥鱼 / Dafeiyu)
-------------------------

The whale girl character is by ZipZipPipe (https://space.bilibili.com/4168597),
as credited by whale-girl. The PNG sprites come from whale-girl
(https://github.com/vlln/whale-girl, commit 2eca153): failed.png joins its
error and disappointed sheets, drag.png is mirrored and peek.png is one frame
of walk.png; the other sheets are unchanged. They are distributed under the
same license:

